ESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h2>Como transformar esas columnas a numero</h2>\n<p>Ya que filtramos las columnas que deberian ser de tipo entero, debemos transformarlas para poder procesarlas</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1752711648257_1747806978","id":"paragraph_1751476122776_1948289936","dateCreated":"2025-07-17T00:20:48+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"import org.apache.spark.sql.functions._\r\n\r\n// Lista de columnas a transformar\r\nval columnas = Seq(\r\n  \"anio_insc\", \"dia_insc\", \"anio_nac\", \"dia_nac\", \"talla\", \"peso\",\r\n  \"sem_gest\", \"apgar1\", \"apgar5\", \"anio_mad\", \"dia_mad\", \"edad_mad\",\r\n  \"con_pren\", \"num_emb\", \"num_par\", \"hij_viv\", \"hij_vivm\", \"hij_nacm\"\r\n)\r\n\r\n// Usando foldLeft para transformar de String a Int\r\nval dfNacidosCleanFinal = columnas.foldLeft(dfENV_copiaClean) { (dfTemp, colName) =>\r\n  dfTemp.withColumn(colName, col(colName).cast(\"int\"))\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Mostrar una muestra de las primeras filas para verificar la transformación\r\ndfNacidosCleanFinal.show()\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-07-17T00:26:52+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"+--------------------+--------------------+--------------------+----------+---------+----------+--------+------+----------+--------+----------+-------+-----+----+--------+---------+--------------------+------+------+------+--------------------+--------------------+--------------------+--------+--------------------+-----------+--------+----------+--------+---------+-------+--------+--------+-------+-------+-------+--------+--------+---------------+---------+----------------+---------------+-----------